#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:510
msgid ""
"The protocol task is scheduled internally now. Calls to ``protocol.poll()`` "
"will raise ``AttributeError``."
msgstr ""
"تُجدوَل مهمة البروتوكول داخليًا الآن. ستطلق استدعاءات ``protocol.poll()`` "
"خطأ ``AttributeError``\\ ."

